TI  - Salinity-Induced Extinction of Zostera marina in Lake Grevelingen? How Strong Habitat Modification May Require Introduction of a Suitable Ecotype
JF  - Sustainability
DO  - 10.3390/su15043472
SN  - 2071-1050
UR  - https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/0b64d3728d3ad35a1e3bd49c814cd823f95e2894
